<https://joinedcontext.com/models/sdm/extensions/PublicInvestment> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "PublicInvestment" ;
    dcterms:license "https://joinedcontext.com/licenses/cc-by-4.0" ;
    dcterms:title "PublicInvestment, an extension of dataModel.CPSV-AP/Cost" ;
    skos:definition "A public investment project, with its place where the source has one. Extends dataModel.CPSV-AP/Cost: CPSV-AP Cost is the official model of an amount a public body pays or charges (value, currency, identifier); no subject holds a contract, order, invoice, grant or procurement." .

